2. Fix

CRUD API route for Listing (paginated list + validated creation) — `app/Http/Controllers/ListingController.php` :
```php
public function index(Request $request)
{
    return response()->json(Listing::latest()->paginate(20));
}

public function store(Request $request)
{
    $donnees = $request->validate([/* règles métier */]);
    $cree = $request->user()->listing()->create($donnees);
    return response()->json($cree, 201);
}
```
Schema validation (zod/pydantic) rejects out-of-bounds parameters BEFORE the database query — the 500 becomes an explicit 400.

3. Prevention

API route test (happy path + unauthenticated) — `tests/listing.test.mjs` :
