6. Implementation steps

1. Initialize the repo, CI and a reproducible local environment.
2. Set up the data model (Property) with versioned migrations.
3. Implement authentication and route protection.
4. Build the Property module: validated API then a four-state UI.
5. Cover edge cases with integration tests (given / when / then).
6. Deploy behind a healthcheck, with backup and documented rollback.

7. Measurable success criteria

- record creation journey under 30 seconds keyboard-only;
- zero 5xx errors across 1,000 real requests;
- list page loads in < 1.5 s on fast 3G;
- every unauthenticated route answers 401 (never 500);
- one account's data is invisible from another account.
